 strongly supported by the given information.\n\nOption A Analysis:\n   - This option implies that transporting a fully assembled wood-chipping machine to and from the logging site would not be necessary.\n   - The information provided explicitly states the requirement of a fully assembled machine at both locations, with no mention of conversion costs.\n   - Hence, this option is in alignment with the given information.\n. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:"]
