ook value, cleaning expenses, and disposal of related taxes and fees is non-operating income.\n- This option is correct. The scrap payment from disposing of environmental protection equipment is typically considered non-operating income as it is not directly related to the company's main business activities.\n\nAfter evaluating all options, the incorrect statement about non-operating income is:\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
