hnology.It only mentions that they are using it to help their students.\n   - **Option C: Golfers are less able to deal with criticism than other athletes**The video is reliable in accurately diagnosing a golf swing, as the golfers' performance is accurately captured and represented in the footage.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:"]
