the most compelling because it directly challenges the core of the statement by providing an alternative explanation for the absence of BGBs in meat that is not roasted at high temperatures. This option most effectively questions the statement by offering a plausible alternative to the provided reasoning.\n</think>\n<answer>A</answer>",
