t-grade students are the children of migrant workers, but it does not specify if these children are third-grade students.Therefore, we cannot conclude that some children of migrant workers are third-grade students.\nThe conclusion is that all first-grade students are children of migrant workers.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:"]
