heir performance or effectiveness in improving gaming experience.It does not question Mr. Tian's point of view.\nThe game experience of users does not depend largely on the graphics card of the laptop, especially because the graphics card of the old laptop is not poor.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:"]
