"The phenomenon of exploitation is bound to appear in the process of economic communication.".The context clearly indicates that exploitation is likely to occur, as it emphasizes the importance of keeping accounts unclear to avoid economic disputes.. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
