messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIntegrity is the foundation of a person. However, when plagiarism, college entrance examination fraud, national fraud, official corruption and bribery are repeatedly exposed, once the moral system collapses, the society will not continue to operate normally. By querying the credit status in the credit record, the problem of social information asymmetry can be alleviated to a great extent and the dishonest can be psychologically deterred.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following can be inferred?\n# Options:\nA) Credit id card has the authority of proof and credibility.\nB) Proof of integrity is not the key to ensuring integrity.\nC) Lack of integrity, the social moral system is on the verge of collapse.\nD) Credit id card is a beneficial attempt to maintain and rebuild social integrity.\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-fc2a8022334b4273ad96f3a37ef5b9a9",
