es are ignored, which is the reason the total cost increase for medium-sized publishing houses is not explicitly addressed.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is: <answer>D</answer> <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c> The correct option is D. <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>",
