ion directly aligns with the context. The context explicitly states that going to the city can better create better sales performance for enterprises and that with policy support and subsidies, enterprises can explore new consumption potential in the urban market.\n\nAfter analyzing all the options, the one that best conforms to the author's point of view is option D.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
