messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nA, B, and C have three balls, one is red, one is blue, and the other is yellow. C is bigger than the yellow ball, A and the blue ball are not the same size, and the blue ball is smaller than C.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options can be inferred?\n# Options:\nA) A is red, b is blue, c is yellow\nB) A is blue, b is yellow, c is red\nC) A is yellow, b is red, c is blue\nD) A is yellow, b is blue, c is red\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
