icates that the initiative has been successful in increasing the number of reported violations, which is a key factor in expanding the scope of traffic supervision and fostering a co-governance situation between the police and the people.\n\nAfter evaluating all the options, the correct option that best supports the expert's conclusion is D.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
