passengers with bus cards.\n     - This involves the government (Nanjing municipal government) setting charging standards for buses. This is an example of national pricing.\n\nBased on the analysis, the only option that does not involve the government setting prices or charging standards is Option A.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
