messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAt present, Tamil, a specific drug for bird flu, has not been registered by the Ministry of Health in Vietnam, so it is difficult to circulate widely in Vietnam.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is the meaning of this sentence?\n# Options:\nA) There is a shortage of drugs to treat bird flu in vietnam.\nB) There is no medicine for bird flu in vietnam.\nC) It will take some time for bird flu specific drugs to circulate widely in vietnam.\nD) The ministry of health of vietnam should register tami fluorocarbons as soon as possible.\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
