dents from the new district. If this is true, it would explain the increase in library card applications without necessarily implying that the number of citizens using the libraries has nearly tripled. This could weaken the conclusion.\n\nAfter analyzing all the options, the one that most effectively weakens the conclusion is:\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>\n</think>",
