ion describes a scenario where Xiao He bought table lamps from a wholesale market and then sold them to his classmates. This does not fit the definition of direct selling because the salesmen are not recruited by a direct selling enterprise and the sales are not done directly to final consumers outside fixed business places.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct option that fits the definition of direct selling is Option C.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>",
