h options A and B fit the definition of a legal result.\n   - Option C does not fit the definition.\n   - Option D fits the definition.\n\nGiven the options, the correct answer is either A or B. Since the problem states that the correct option is provided, and both A and B fit the definition, we need to choose one. \n\nSince the problem specifies that the correct option is provided and both A and B fit, I will choose the first correct option listed in the options provided.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is: A.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
