es not weaken the argument. It suggests that the stones could have been reused, but it does not provide any information about the age of the organic matter found on the monument.\n\nAfter analyzing all the options, the one that most seriously weakens the argument is option B.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>",
