ars have altered the natural habitat of the tidal wetlands, turning them into woodlands where rats can thrive. This change in the ecosystem is likely contributing to the rat disaster.\n\nBased on this analysis, the option that does not support the expert's point of view is:\n</think>\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>",
