ational role of material means of livelihood but is not the main point.\n\n4. **Conclusion**:\n   - The passage primarily focuses on Marx's discovery of the law of human history and its foundational importance.\n   - Option B most accurately captures this main idea.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is:\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>",
