messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nPrecise poverty alleviation can not only focus on individual facts and solve individual problems, but do not know how to link individual poverty or special poverty with the macro background of economic and social development. It should be clearly recognized that although all kinds of special poverty have special factors, special poverty also exists in the context of the current information society. Informatization and networking contain very rich resources and energy. we should vigorously support the poor or poor groups to understand and adapt to the new situation of informatization and networking as soon as possible, through technical training and typical demonstration, the poor who are far away from informationization and networking should be introduced into this historical process.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is the most appropriate keyword extracted from this passage?\n# Options:\nA) Precise poverty alleviation, information society, technical training\nB) Precise poverty alleviation, special poverty, typical demonstration\nC) Poor groups, macro background, information society\nD) Poor groups, special poverty, technical training\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
