rice of white sugar has risen significantly, it is more likely that consumers would reduce their purchases, even if they are not necessarily aware of the harmfulness of sugar. This option directly challenges the conclusion by suggesting that the decline in sales could be due to economic factors rather than public awareness.\n\nAfter evaluating all the options, the one that most weakens the conclusion is option D. Therefore, the correct answer is D.\n</answer>",
