f the training. It suggests that the training will focus on reducing the most costly collisions, thereby significantly lowering the repair costs.\n   - Option C directly addresses the core of the question by explaining the expected outcome of the training program.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is C.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>",
