 worker bees suddenly disappear or die.\n     - Therefore, we cannot infer this from the given information.\n\nBased on the analysis, the option that cannot be inferred from the original text is:\n</think>\n<answer>\nA) Queen bees are more resistant to colony collapse syndrome than worker bees.\n</answer>",
