messages:  ["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAfter Xiaoding presented fan with his 2005 annual statistical report, Fan saw at once that one of the statistics was flawed. He said to xiaoding: This statistic is wrong, please check whether the original data is wrong or the calculation is wrong?After Xiaoding carefully calculated, the result shows that the calculation is wrong.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, accordingly, which of the following options can be inferred?\n# Options:\nA) There's a problem with the original data.\nB) There's nothing wrong with the original data.\nC) It is not certain whether the original data is wrong.\nD) It is certain  whether the original data is wrong.\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:"]
