messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe counter-trend expansion refers to the business behavior that enterprises further consolidate and expand the market and take the lead in the competition under the situation of great pressure and difficulty.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following are not the counter-trend expansion?\n# Options:\nA) While the market share of most domestic brands of color tv has declined, a tv manufacturer has launched several super tvs in succession, which makes its market share increase and far ahead of several big ocean brands.\nB) An automobile fuel tank sales company is a large-scale independent brand export enterprise in china. the company has recently entered the pre-disclosure update list, which is a further step towards the goal of listing.\nC) When it is generally believed that the real estate control policy will seriously affect the home furnishing industry units, a certain brand of furniture announced in a high-profile manner that it has recently successfully opened a number of franchise stores in the provincial capital and surrounding areas.\nD) The recent performance of the domestic retail industry has been poor. various sales companies have shrunk their physical positions. today, a private company has added a shopping mall in the provincial capital and the other two will open soon.\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
