messages:  ["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nOur parents pay more and more attention to children's reading. Most parents want their children to read more and read better books. In 2018,70.3 percent of families in one city had the habit of parents reading with their children. The amount of books read by parents and children increased by 1.8 percentage points compared to 2017 and the length of books read also increased compared to last year. But in 2018, the city's children read just 4.72 books per person, down 0.6 percentage points from 2017.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following, if true, best explains the phenomenon?\n# Options:\nA) In recent years, children have a heavy burden of schoolwork and many people want to read extracurricular reading but do not have enough time.\nB) Most parents born in the 1980s and 1990s are highly educated and value reading for their children.\nC) Many children are used to listening to books in parent-child reading, which is not counted in 2018.\nD) Electronic reading by parents on mobile phones and computers has not been taken into account in children's books.\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:"]
