n D:**\n   - \"There were more physical therapists than dieticians at Happywell last year.\"\n   - This statement is not necessarily true. The average salaries do not provide information about the number of employees in each category. It is possible that there were more dieticians than physical therapists, or vice versa, or they could be in equal numbers. Therefore, this option cannot be concluded from the given information.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - After analyzing all the options, the only conclusion that can be properly drawn based on the given information is that at least one Happywell employee earned less than the average for a physical therapist last year.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is: <answer>B</answer> <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c> The correct option is B. <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>",
