messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nToday, with the prevalence of professionalism, the interview work of journalists is increasingly becoming an assembly line, and the step-by-step framework of news production masks the necessity and importance of many principles. However, this earthquake has to a large extent revived the moral requirements in news reports-the morality here is not only a simple judgment of right and wrong, good and evil and the observance of professional ethics, but also extensive and strong humanistic care, and the courage behind the care.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options best summarizes the above paragraph?\n# Options:\nA) The earthquake once again awakened the moral demands of long-neglected news reports\nB) News reporting needs to have moral requirements\nC) The moral requirements of news reporting include not only professional ethics, but also humanistic care and courage\nD) Journalists should report the earthquake in accordance with the requirements of journalistic ethics\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
