messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAfter the Revolution of 1911, there was a massive loss of old collections and palace relics in the Forbidden City. At this time, these used to be almost unknown outside China, even ordinary Chinese themselves do not know much about the official kiln porcelain continue to show in the world. Therefore, when some tourists visit several foreign museums and see some official kiln porcelain in the collection, they take it for granted that the lofty evaluation of Chinese porcelain in western history is aimed at the official kiln. This is really a historical misunderstanding.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the most likely content to be discussed in this passage?\n# Options:\nA) The history of chinese porcelain exported to the west\nB) Evaluation of chinese porcelain in western history\nC) The spread of official kiln porcelain among the folk\nD) The cause of this historical misunderstanding\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
