requency or intensity) rather than climate warming. Therefore, this option weakens the conclusion.\n\nAfter analyzing all the options, we can conclude that option B is the only one that does not weaken the conclusion that climate warming leads to an increase in tornado outbreaks.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe correct option is B.\n</answer>",
