messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIn recent years, with the continuous increase in the number of IT manufacturers, the competition in the IT market has become increasingly fierce. Users of IT products require not only the choice of the product itself, but also the choice of good service has become an important factor in the purchase decision of users.Survey data show that for high-tech products, such as computers, users are willing to spend 10% more on services and good goods of the same quality.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following can express the meaning of this passage?\n# Options:\nA) After sales service of it products is very important\nB) It products are highly serviceable\nC) It products are highly specialized and have high technical requirements\nD) Users are willing to spend more money on it products\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
