 be concluded as true based on the given information.\n\nD) Contours and hatching are the main features that distinguish the drawing styles of different artists.\n- The context only mentions that contour and hatching styles can be used to distinguish between Michelangelo's and Clovio's works. It does not state that these are the only features or that they are the main distinguishing features for all artists. Therefore, this option cannot be concluded as true based on the given information.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct option that must be true is B.\n</answer>",
