henomenon where the color perception changes based on context. It does not involve any temporary coloring of the original red color. Therefore, it does not fit the definition of a negative image.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct option that fits the definition of a negative image is:\n\nThe correct option is: <B>\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>\n</answer>",
