ue.\n\n**Option D: W was assigned to the public relations department.**\n- If X and F are assigned to the same department, and F is assigned to the production department, then X must also be assigned to the production department.\n- Since F is in the production department, X must be in the production department as well.\n- This leaves three spots in the sales department (G, H, and I).\n- Since H and Y must be in the same department, and H is already in the production department, Y must be in the production department.\n- This leaves G and I in the sales department.\n- If X and F are in the production department, then W must be in the sales department (Condition 3).\n- Therefore, W cannot be in the public relations department. This statement cannot be true.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct option is:\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
