terprise.\n     - This involves the software company developing and improving a financial management system for the enterprise.\n     - This fits the definition of outsourcing as the company is providing IT services to the enterprise.\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - Option A and Option B do not fit the definition of information system outsourcing.\n   - Option C fits the definition.\n   - Option D fits the definition.\n\nTherefore, the correct option that does not belong to information system outsourcing is:\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
