messages:  ["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nSince the sealed test paper is so fair to the college entrance examination, why do Fan Zhongyan, Su Song and others oppose it? However, just as Bao Zheng refuted Fan Zhongyan, it is difficult to verify a person's actual virtue, not to mention that the examiner may not be able to take people with public interest. They either take advantage of their elegance, hand in hand, love or hate, or be forced by the situation, or bribe. It is easy to do unfair things. It is still imperative to seal the college entrance examination papers in order to maintain the public means of college entrance examination.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, through the above words, which of the following does the author want to express?\n# Options:\nA) There are inevitable defects in the sealing system of college entrance examination.\nB) The selection of talents should pay attention to the investigation of morality and talent.\nC) It is often difficult for imperial examiners to be fair and impartial.\nD) Relatively speaking, college entrance examination paper sealing is a more reasonable system.\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:"]
