 the challenges but still supports the sealing system.\n\nAfter careful consideration, the option that best captures the author's main point is B. The author emphasizes the need to investigate both morality and talent, which aligns with the idea that the selection of talents should pay attention to these aspects.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>",
