tes that reform is necessary to develop productivity.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct option that can be deduced from the context is Option A.\n\nTherefore, the final answer is: <answer>A</answer> <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c> </think>\n<answer>A</answer> <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c> </think>",
