e new furnaces are more fuel-efficient than the current open furnaces.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - The Supervisor agrees with the Plant Manager's conclusion that the new process will cost more and bring no profit.\n   - The Supervisor disagrees with the Plant Manager's point about the new process being more expensive to run.\n   - The Supervisor's disagreement is specifically about the fuel efficiency of the new furnaces.\n\nTherefore, the point about which the Supervisor expresses disagreement with the Plant Manager is:\nThe correct option is: D\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
