 Option D is the most comprehensive and accurate description of genetically modified crops based on the given context.\n\nTherefore, the correct understanding of the concept of genetically modified crops is:\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>FAILED. Therefore, my final option is:\nThe correct option is: D\n</answer>",
