ne that best summarizes the overall information provided.\n\nThe most comprehensive and accurate option that encapsulates both the harmful and beneficial effects of MSG is:\n- **Option C:** \"Monosodium glutamate can improve people's food and martial arts, and has a certain tonic effect on the human body\"\n\nTherefore, the final answer is:\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>\n</think> <|Assistant|> <answer>\nC\n</answer>\n</think>",
