 pollution from cars.\n\nAfter evaluating all the options, the one that most directly undermines the politician's argument is option A, as it suggests that even if hybrid cars are more fuel-efficient, the increased driving could negate the benefits in terms of total pollution reduction.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe correct option is A.\n</answer>",
