d be implemented without the need for the radical plan. While it provides an alternative, it does not directly argue against the plan based on the trial results. It merely offers a different approach.\n\nAfter analyzing all the options, the one that most strongly argues against deciding to implement the company's plan based on the trial results is option C.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>",
