messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe Internet of things application standing at the tuyere was actually a bicycle in 2016. The sharing economy has brought bicycles back to the city. Because of its flexibility and convenience, low-carbon environmental protection has become a common short-distance walking artifact in many cities, realizing resource sharing to the greatest extent. However, the resulting problem of random parking of shared bicycles can be seen everywhere in the green belt, sidewalk and in front of shopping malls; Throw away the garbage at will. There are many rivers and rivers; Park in your garage and take it for yourself; There are some people who steal QR codes to make money... Citizens have a weak awareness of rules, lack of social credit system, and inadequate urban infrastructure... The original win-win situation is likely to cause lose more because a few people do not abide by the rules.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings is the most suitable title for this paragraph?\n# Options:\nA) Sharing bicycles and asking about the short board of sharing economic development\nB) Thoughts on sharing bicycles\nC) Establishment of rule consciousness in the era of sharing economy\nD) Sharing economy and exchanging social integrity\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:']
