 to pass the postgraduate entrance examination.\n- This option suggests that not attending an English tutoring class will result in failing the examination. However, the context does not provide any information about the consequences of not attending a tutoring class. This option does not strengthen the argument based on the given information.\n\nAfter analyzing all the options, the one that best strengthens the argument is option B, as it directly supports the necessity of attending an English tutoring class for those who intend to take the postgraduate entrance examination.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>",
