bility and appreciation of nature, which can lead to a sense of responsibility to protect nature. However, it does not fully capture the main point of the paragraph, which is the broader role of poetry in ecological civilization.\n\nBased on this analysis, the option that best captures the main point of the paragraph is B.\n</answer>",
