eparation.\"\n     - This option describes Xiao Li preparing for an interview by dressing and styling himself. This is a clear example of Xiao Li managing and controlling how others perceive him. By dressing and styling himself, Xiao Li is trying to present himself in a way that is appropriate for the interview context, ensuring a favorable impression.\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - Based on the definition of impression management, the correct option is D, as Xiao Li is actively preparing to manage how others perceive him during the interview.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is: <answer>D</answer> <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c> </think>\n<answer>D</answer> <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c> </think>",
