messages:  ["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nDisturbance of perceptive synthesis refers to that the patient is correct as an objective whole when perceiving a real thing, but has a perception inconsistent with the individual attributes of the thing, such as size, shape, color, spatial distance, etc.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the followings belongss to disturbance of perceptive synthesis?\n# Options:\nA) Wang often had hallucinations because he was addicted to the game, and the scene of fighting in the game appeared in front of him\nB) Zhang often feels that the pendulum that is swinging has stopped swinging recently\nC) Due to his high myopia, li often recognizes the wrong person in the street and is very depressed\nD) Sun's ability to distinguish colors is poor. the doctor found that this is a manifestation of color weakness\nFAILED. Therefore, my final option is: \nThe correct option is:"]
