evements may not be realized.\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - Option A is a part of the context but not the main emphasis.\n   - Option B is not the main focus of the context.\n   - Option C is partially correct but not the main emphasis.\n   - Option D encapsulates the core message of the context, emphasizing the importance of protecting human value for the successful realization of entrepreneurship and innovation.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is:\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
