 right to redistribute resources via taxation, which he believes is justified by the freedom to leave.\n   - **Raphaela and Edward disagree on this point.**\n\nD) **Every government should allow people to help others voluntarily.**\n   - Raphaela believes that people should be able to help others voluntarily.\n   - Edward supports the right to redistribute resources via taxation, which he believes is justified by the freedom to leave.\n   - **Raphaela and Edward agree on this point.**\n\nBased on the analysis, Raphaela and Edward disagree on the following statements:\n- Option A: They agree.\n- Option B: They disagree.\n- Option C: They disagree.\n- Option D: They agree.\n\nSince the question asks for the disagreement between Raphaela and Edward, the correct option is C.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>",
